      "walkthrough": [
        "Evaluate $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = 24(3 - 2x)$ at $x = \\frac{1}{2}$:\n$$\\left.\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}\\right|_{x=1/2} = 24(3 - 1) = 48 > 0 \\implies \\text{Minimum at } \\left(\\frac{1}{2}, 20\\right)$$",
        "Evaluate $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}$ at $x = \\frac{5}{2}$:\n$$\\left.\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}\\right|_{x=5/2} = 24(3 - 5) = -48 < 0 \\implies \\text{Maximum at } \\left(\\frac{5}{2}, 52\\right)$$",
